nav-products\">PRODUCTS <span>⌄</span></button><button data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"Indoor vs Outdoor LED Screen: Which Do You Need in Dubai?\", \"description\": \"Brightness, IP rating, pixel pitch and cost \\u2014 the practical differences between indoor and outdoor LED screens for Dubai projects, and how to choose.\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog/indoor-vs-outdoor-led-screen-dubai\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/opt_fam_naturatex.webp\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"datePublished\": \"2026-08-19\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-08-19\", \"articleSection\": \"LED Display Technology\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I use an indoor LED screen outdoors in Dubai?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No \\u2014 indoor panels lack the brightness (5,000+ nits needed), IP65 weather sealing and thermal design for Dubai's sun, dust and heat. They fail quickly and look washed out in daylight.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What brightness do I need for an outdoor LED screen in Dubai?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"5,000\\u20138,000 nits for direct-sun locations, with automatic ambient dimming at night to comply with RTA limits for road-facing screens.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which is cheaper, indoor or outdoor LED?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Per square metre, outdoor coarse-pitch screens (AED 3,900\\u20139,500/m\\u00b2) are usually cheaper than indoor fine-pitch (from AED 7,500/m\\u00b2), but outdoor projects add structural steel, cranage and power works.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Blog\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Indoor vs Outdoor LED Screen: Which Do You Need in Dubai?\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog/indoor-vs-outdoor-led-screen-dubai\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Indoor vs Outdoor LED Screen: Which Do You Need in Dubai?</h1><p>Blog — Indoor Vs Outdoor Led Screen Dubai. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>Brightness, IP rating, pixel pitch and cost — the practical differences between indoor and outdoor LED screens for Dubai projects, and how to choose.</p><div><h2>The 60-second answer</h2><p>Choose an <strong>outdoor LED screen in Dubai</strong> when the display faces direct sunlight or weather: you need 5,000+ nits brightness, IP65 sealing and coarser pitch (P4–P10). Choose an <strong>indoor LED screen</strong> for lobbies, retail and boardrooms: 600–1,200 nits is enough, no weather sealing needed, and budgets go into finer pixel pitch (P1.2–P2.5) for close viewing.</p><h2>Brightness: Dubai sun changes everything</h2><p>Dubai's direct sun demands 5,000–8,000 nits for legible daytime content; indoor screens at 800 nits would look switched off outdoors. Conversely, running an outdoor panel indoors wastes money and blinds viewers — auto-dimming helps but the panel cost is already spent.</p><h2>IP rating and Dubai's climate</h2><p>Outdoor panels need IP65 front and rear against dust storms, humidity and 50°C summers, with conformal-coated boards for coastal salt air. Indoor panels are typically IP30 and lighter, enabling slimmer cabinets and easier mounting.</p><h2>Pixel pitch and viewing distance</h2><p>Outdoor audiences are far away, so P6–P10 looks perfect from 20m+ at a fraction of fine-pitch cost. Indoor viewers stand 2–6m away, needing P1.2–P2.5. Use our <a href=\"/viewing-distance\">viewing distance calculator</a> to match pitch to your audience.</p><h2>Cost comparison</h2><p>Per square metre, outdoor screens run AED 3,900–9,500 and indoor fine-pitch from AED 7,500 — full ranges in our <a href=\"/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\">UAE pricing guide</a>. Outdoor projects add structure, cranage and DEWA power works; indoor projects add wall preparation and processing.</p><h2>Semi-outdoor: the middle case</h2><p>Window-facing displays behind glass (mall shopfronts, car showrooms) need 3,500+ nits to beat glass reflection but not full IP65 — a distinct specification many suppliers get wrong. Our <a href=\"/glassmorph\">transparent LED range</a> is built exactly for this case.</p><p>Still unsure? Browse <a href=\"/indoor-led\">indoor LED</a> and <a href=\"/outdoor-led\">outdoor LED</a> ranges, or ask our <a href=\"/dubai\">LED display company in Dubai</a> — send a photo of your location and we'll specify it the same day.</p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>Can I use an indoor LED screen outdoors in Dubai?</h3><p>No — indoor panels lack the brightness (5,000+ nits needed), IP65 weather sealing and thermal design for Dubai's sun, dust and heat. They fail quickly and look washed out in daylight.</p><h3>What brightness do I need for an outdoor LED screen in Dubai?</h3><p>5,000–8,000 nits for direct-sun locations, with automatic ambient dimming at night to comply with RTA limits for road-facing screens.</p><h3>Which is cheaper, indoor or outdoor LED?</h3><p>Per square metre, outdoor coarse-pitch screens (AED 3,900–9,500/m²) are usually cheaper than indoor fine-pitch (from AED 7,500/m²), but outdoor projects add structural steel, cranage and power works.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a><a href=\"/case-studies\">CASE STUDIES</a><a href=\"/blog\">BLOG</a></section><section><h2>LOCATIONS</h2><a href=\"/dubai\">DUBAI</a><a href=\"/abu-dhabi\">ABU DHABI</a><a href=\"/saudi-arabia\">SAUDI ARABIA</a><a href=\"/qatar\">QATAR</a><a href=\"/kuwait\">KUWAIT</a><a href=\"/bahrain\">BAHRAIN</a><a href=\"/oman\">OMAN</a></section><section><h2>COMPANY</h2><a href=\"/about\">ABOUT US</a><a href=\"/contact\">CONTACT US</a><a href=\"/factory-tour\">FACTORY TOUR</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"/resources\">RESOURCES</a></section><section><h2>CONTACT</h2><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Jebel+Ali+Industrial+Area+1+Dubai\" data-testid=\"footer-map-link\">Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1, Dubai, UAE</a><a href=\"tel:+97142585754\" data-testid=\"footer-phone-link\">+971 4 258 5754</a><a href=\"mailto:sales@brightluxx.com\" data-testid=\"footer-email-link\">sales@brightluxx.com</a></sect