 and heat. They fail quickly and look washed out in daylight.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What brightness do I need for an outdoor LED screen in Dubai?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"5,000\\\\u20138,000 nits for direct-sun locations, with automatic ambient dimming at night to comply with RTA limits for road-facing screens.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Which is cheaper, indoor or outdoor LED?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Per square metre, outdoor coarse-pitch screens (AED 3,900\\\\u20139,500/m\\\\u00b2) are usually cheaper than indoor fine-pitch (from AED 7,500/m\\\\u00b2), but outdoor projects add structural steel, cranage and power works.\\\"}}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Blog\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Indoor vs Outdoor LED Screen: Which Do You Need in Dubai?\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/indoor-vs-outdoor-led-screen-dubai\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}],\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:Tce3,<h1>Indoor vs Outdoor LED Screen: Which Do You Need in Dubai?</h1><p>Blog — Indoor Vs Outdoor Led Screen Dubai. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>Brightness, IP rating, pixel pitch and cost — the practical differences between indoor and outdoor LED screens for Dubai projects, and how to choose.</p><div><h2>The 60-second answer</h2><p>Choose an <strong>outdoor LED screen in Dubai</strong> when the display faces direct sunlight or weather: you need 5,000+ nits brightness, IP65 sealing and coarser pitch (P4–P10). Choose an <strong>indoor LED screen</strong> for lobbies, retail and boardrooms: 600–1,200 nits is enough, no weather sealing needed, and budgets go into finer pixel pitch (P1.2–P2.5) for close viewing.</p><h2>Brightness: Dubai sun changes everything</h2><p>Dubai's direct sun demands 5,000–8,000 nits for legible daytime content; indoor screens at 800 nits would look switched off outdoors. Conversely, running an outdoor panel indoors wastes money and blinds viewers — auto-dimming helps but the panel cost is already spent.</p><h2>IP rating and Dubai's climate</h2><p>Outdoor panels need IP65 front and rear against dust storms, humidity and 50°C summers, with conformal-coated boards for coastal salt air. Indoor panels are typically IP30 and lighter, enabling slimmer cabinets and easier mounting.</p><h2>Pixel pitch and viewing distance</h2><p>Outdoor audiences are far away, so P6–P10 looks perfect from 20m+ at a fraction of fine-pitch cost. Indoor viewers stand 2–6m away, needing P1.2–P2.5. Use our <a href=\"/viewing-distance\">viewing distance calculator</a> to match pitch to your audience.</p><h2>Cost comparison</h2><p>Per square metre, outdoor screens run AED 3,900–9,500 and indoor fine-pitch from AED 7,500 — full ranges in our <a href=\"/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\">UAE pricing guide</a>. Outdoor projects add structure, cranage and DEWA power works; indoor projects add wall preparation and processing.</p><h2>Semi-outdoor: the middle case</h2><p>Window-facing displays behind glass (mall shopfronts, car showrooms) need 3,500+ nits to beat glass reflection but not full IP65 — a distinct specification many suppliers get wrong. Our <a href=\"/glassmorph\">transparent LED range</a> is built exactly for this case.</p><p>Still unsure? Browse <a href=\"/indoor-led\">indoor LED</a> and <a href=\"/outdoor-led\">outdoor LED</a> ranges, or ask our <a href=\"/dubai\">LED display company in Dubai</a> — send a photo of your location and we'll specify it the same day.</p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>Can I use an indoor LED screen outdoors in Dubai?</h3><p>No — indoor panels lack the brightness (5,000+ nits needed), IP65 weather sealing and thermal design for Dubai's sun, dust and heat. They fail quickly and look washed out in daylight.</p><h3>What brightness do I need for an outdoor LED screen in Dubai?</h3><p>5,000–8,000 nits for direct-sun locations, with automatic ambient dimming at night to comply with RTA limits for road-facing screens.</p><h3>Which is cheaper, indoor or outdoor LED?</h3><p>Per square metre, outdoor coarse-pitch screens (AED 3,900–9,500/m²) are usually cheaper than indoor fine-pitch (from AED 7,500/m²), but outdoor projects add structural steel, cranage and power works.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Blog — Indoor Vs Outdoor Led Screen Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Blog — Indoor Vs Outdoor Led Screen Dubai. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/indoor-vs-outdoor-led-screen-dubai\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n6:X\nb:X\nb:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"asUR9PKHczPTqM_U7zeiu\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"applicati